          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Item 1",
        "text_hash": "c5ddfeffb275254140796b8c080f372d65ebb1b0590e238b191f595d5fcd32ca",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000140-4045a828",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/p[1]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 140,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our database, business intelligence, and data warehousing solutions offerings compete with products from providers in the data and analytics industry. Our system management solutions compete with server management and server virtualization platform providers. Our products for software developers compete against offerings from major technology providers, as well as open source alternatives.",
        "text_hash": "4045a828d5ce8fa43bb65f84b9d1c23885ed166d65bcebf9aedc6364544d1f0f",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000141-879cac60",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/p[2]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 141,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "We believe our server products provide customers with advantages in performance, total costs of ownership, and productivity by delivering superior applications, development tools, compatibility with a broad base of hardware and software applications, security, and manageability.",
        "text_hash": "879cac60e56dc3f0946a2eea198cb6f06466e7b2a737a2b938b33737861925d9",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000142-3e738e53",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/p[3]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 142,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our Enterprise and partner services business competes with a wide range of companies that provide strategy and business planning, application development, and infrastructure services, including multinational consulting firms and small niche businesses focused on specific technologies.",
        "text_hash": "3e738e537a6ba671c210d9708a833ffc4cd8a67a9ab774c2cb5b38f71020b859",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000143-c67f142f",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/p[4]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 143,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "bold"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "13.5pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "left"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "More Personal Computing",
        "text_hash": "c67f142f1ff0a8e0e21f763ca81edaa4b8c71ef43e8a41cf5ffe4103b273779f",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000144-6e0ae0c4",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/p[5]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 144,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our More Personal Computing segment consists of products and services that put customers at the center of the experience with our technology. This segment primarily comprises:",
        "text_hash": "6e0ae0c4087ac566b8e2f526bc149145e95f4512862546ec023ff089ee335a6a",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000145-4f8865ab",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/div[1]/span",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 145,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "•",
        "text_hash": "4f8865abeddbfab37520d0c56eed1bf17f37e3778e1a55e6dc54895d2ae17849",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000146-c641cfcd",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/div[1]/div",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 146,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "arial"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Windows and Devices, including Windows OEM licensing (Windows Pro and non-Pro licenses sold through the OEM channel) and Devices, comprising Surface and PC accessories.",
        "text_hash": "c641cfcd89511a2dcaa3efc45af8ce2a8e4a95c7a34cdcb4df86c26459ed9de8",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000147-4f8865ab",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/div[2]/span",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 147,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "•",
        "text_hash": "4f8865abeddbfab37520d0c56eed1bf17f37e3778e1a55e6dc54895d2ae17849",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000148-2f215a60",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[24]/div[2]/div",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 148,
        "reported_page": 8,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "arial"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Gaming, including Xbox hardware and Xbox content and services, comprising first- and third-party content (including games and in-game content), Xbox Game Pass and other subscriptions, Xbox Cloud Gaming, advertising, and other cloud services.",
        "text_hash": "2f215a60d89b2281b04683e06c9d8b1cdc04d615d4f5cb1e3e8e8503f1fc29b0",
        "type": "paragraph"
      }
